<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 579.11, down 4.81.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 307 to 225.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.11.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 23,319,340, compared with 22,443,900 Wednesday.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1330 EST/1830 GMT)</p>
</text>
